    "updated_at": "2025-07-20T04:19:39Z",
    "body": "Presumably we need to do for this what we've done for other headers like `X-Frame-Options` and define an actual imperative parsing algorithm, by reverse-engineering existing browsers. The first step would be for someone to look at the three major engines' open source implementations to check how well their algorithms match each other.",
