    "created_at": "2025-10-09T13:28:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-09T13:28:33Z",
    "body": "There's no issue tracker for this RFC that I'm aware of. @mnot can hopefully advise. If there's no interest in figuring out the interoperability story for this header on the IETF side, I think what Domenic suggested above is probably the best way forward. We've done that for many headers.\n\nA good initial step for either initiative would be to expand on the existing test suite and make it reusable outside of browsers, if it isn't already (e.g., by having the inputs and outputs in a JSON resource).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
